<p>					   533			  7,500</p>
<p>(1) Q1 1996 includes unusual pretax loss of $7,500,000 for restructuring to move headquarters from Los Angeles, California to Lancaster, Pennsylvania and to relocate wide mouth jar operations from Santa Fe Springs, Calif. to Bowling Green, Ky. Loss consisted of reserves of $7,500,000 for i) severance of $500,000, iv) asset retirements of $300,000, and v) other costs of $200,000.</p>
<p>(e) Company has not declared a dividend on its Class B, Series D Preferred Stock since Q1 1996. Cumulative amount of undeclared dividends as of March 31, 1997 is $829,000. Under the terms of a new $8,500,000 working capital facility, the Company may not declare or pay dividends on preferred stock.</p>
<p>(f)  Weighted average common shares outstanding for three months ended March 31, 1997 and 1996 was 3,933,000.</p>
